msgstr "AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:16
msgid ""
"When enabled, |morpheus| will maintain the expected power state of managed "
"VMs. |morpheus| will power on any managed VMs in the Cloud that have been "
"shut down for unknown reasons (not powered off by |morpheus|) to ensure "
"availability of services."
msgstr ""
"When habilitado, |morpheus| será maintain el expected power state of managed"
" VMs. |morpheus| será power on cualquier managed VMs in el Cloud que tienen "
"sido shut down para unknown reasons (no powered off by |morpheus|) to ensure"
" availability of servicios."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/base_options.rst:18
msgid ""
"When \"AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS\" is enabled, the power state of managed "
"VMs should be maintained in |morpheus|. This setting is not applicable to "
"discovered/unmanaged resources."
msgstr ""
"When \"AUTOMATICALLY POWER ON VMS\" es habilitado, el power state of managed"
" VMs debería be maintained in |morpheus|. This setting no es applicable to "
"discovered/unmanaged recursos."

